msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-audit.md
msgid "Keep a durable record of who accessed or changed what."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-audit.md
msgid "Why"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-audit.md
msgid "Platform audit retention is usually shorter than legal retention, so audit is copied out. Query text can itself contain personal data."
